  m_Name: Hint_Step_31_FirewallCheck
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: Hint
    text: "<b>Windows Defender Firewall \u25B8 Advanced Settings \u25B8 Inbound Rules</b>.\n\nConfirm
      <b>Remote Desktop</b> is allowed on the profile in use.\n\nSwitching the firewall
      off would also make it work, and would be the wrong answer - the rule is the
      fix, not the firewall."
